ph – the people in the picture are eerily faceless! A powerful intuition compels you to journey to the location in the photo: Greenwater Town. However, this town, named after a \"green pond,\" is far more sinister than its name suggests.\n\nGame Features\nImmersive Story Experience: Follow in the footsteps of the protagonist, delve deeper into the mysteries of Greenwater Town. Experience the oppressive atmosphere and enigmatic aura of the town from a first-person perspective.\nBrain-Teasing Puzzle Exploration: From a stalled car to bizarre houses, each scene conceals clues and puzzles. You'll need keen observation, item collection, and puzzle-solving skills to gradually unveil the truth of Greenwater Town.\nUnique Atmospheric Horror: Black and white photos, faceless figures, a rainy town at night, and eerie sound effects combine to create a disturbing atmosphere, keeping you on edge with suspense and curiosity.\nInterconnected Puzzle Design: Each puzzle is intricately woven into the scenes and storyline. Logical deduction and sharp observation are crucial to find answers and advance the narrative.\nMulti-Interactive Experience: Click, drag, combine items, and interact with the environment in diverse ways, experiencing the genuine fun of exploration.\n\nYou will experience\nLayered Suspense: Starting with a bizarre photo, the mystery deepens, the truth becomes increasingly elusive, keeping you captivated and wanting more.\nMeticulously Detailed Scenes: Every scene is meticulously designed, brimming with details, awaiting your discovery of hidden clues.\nThrilling Puzzle-Solving Process: In the silent town, you will face unknown fears alone, challenging your wisdom and courage.\n\nGreenwater Town, a town full of secrets, awaits your brave exploration and unveiling.", "bundleId": "com.cottongame.greenpondtown", "userRatingCount": 3}]}